(2) K.H. Guber, Private communication, 2008.                      2825 1451
(3) A. Brusegan et al., Int. Conf. Nucl. Data for Science and     2825 1451
    Technology, Gatlinburg May 1994, Vol.1, page 224.             2825 1451
(4) G. Arbanas, Private Communication, 2008.                      2825 1451
(5) S.F. Mughabghab,Atlas of Neutron Resonances, Elsevier, 2006   2825 1451
